  - doc-block anchors: check:spec-docblock-symbol-anchors, check:doc-anchors, check:symbol-anchors;
  - tests: spec `src/ui` + `src/conversions` (192 files / 6778 tests), lint (183 files, after a rebuild of the stale dist), metadata-protocol (286 files);
  - typechecks: spec, lint and metadata-protocol `typecheck` / `check:test-typecheck`, `@object-ui/types` and plugin-detail type-check;
  - ui parity pins: 6 files / 184 tests.

